.TH KAGI-VOLUME-HYPERVISOR-NOTES 1 "September 2026" "Kagi 0.38.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
kagi-volume-hypervisor-notes \- display Kagi hypervisor integration notes
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kagi-volume-hypervisor-notes
.SH DESCRIPTION
Prints operational notes for mapping Kagi volumes into KVM/QEMU, VMware, and Hyper-V environments, including the boundary between Kagi block transport and guest-visible paravirtualized SCSI controllers.
